ry, hint: refine_candidates 或 starter_prompt)\n\nsemantic_payload: `{"kind": "saved_search_opt_in"}`\n\n检查工具调用要求：\n- 只有用户明确同意“继续留意”时才调用 `create_saved_search_subscription_from_last_search`。现在还没同意，所以不调用。\n- phase: `no_result`\n- criteria_labels: ["江浙沪", "女", "26-36岁", "先谈恋爱"] (最多6个)\n\n构造输出。', 'type': 'summary_text'}], 'type': 'reasoning'}, {'content': [{'annotations': [], 'text': '{\n  "assistant_message": "帮你把范围扩大到江浙沪主要城市也扫了一遍，不过目前库里刚好没有 26-36 岁、也在认真找对象的女生。别担心，这种冷启动阶段偶尔会碰到。我可以先帮你把这个条件挂上，一旦有合适的新朋友注册加入，我第一时间推给你。另外，如果愿意把年龄范围稍微放宽一点（比如 24-38），我也可以现在再帮你跑一轮看看。",\n  "phase": "no_result",\n  "criteria_labels": [\n    "江浙沪",\n    "女",\n    "26-36岁",\n    "先谈恋爱"\n  ],\n  "suggested_actions": [\n    {\n      "action_id": "act-save-search-01",\n      "hint": {\n        "kind": "saved_search_opt_in",\n        "slot": "default"\n      },\n      "label": "有新人时提醒我",\n      "style": "primary"\n    },\n    {\n      "action_id": "act-refine-age-01",\n      "hint": {\n        "kind": "refine_candidates",\n        "slot": "age_range"\n      },\n      "label": "放宽年龄再试试",\n      "style": "secondary"\n    }\n  ],\n  "semantic_payload": {\n    "kind": "saved_search_opt_in"\n  }\n}', 'type': 'output_text'}], 'id': 'msg_5f721253-2bce-4d9e-8ffe-3778324c846c', 'role': 'assistant', 'status': 'completed', 'type': 'message'}, {'content': '{"clicked_action": {"hint": {}, "label": "放宽年龄再试试"}, "event": "action_click", "latest_user_message": null, "note": "Use official_context as the current source of truth for product state. Agent memory only helps you remember prior chat. Do not invent candidate raw fields; only select profile_id values from the latest search tool response.", "official_context": {"last_search_summary": {"criteria": {"age_max": 36, "age_min": 26, "cities": ["上海", "南京", "苏州", "杭州", "宁波", "无锡", "常州", "嘉兴"], "gender": "female", "relationship_goals": ["dating", "认真恋爱"]}, "has_match": false, "result_count": 0, "search_run_id": 24, "source": "mysql://root@127.0.0.1:3307/her?table=profiles"}, "page_summary": {"criteria_labels": ["江浙沪", "女", "26-36岁", "先谈恋爱"], "result_cards": [], "suggested_action_labels": ["有新人时提醒我", "放宽年龄再试试"]}, "recent_timeline_summary": [{"body": "根据你刚填的资料，我先帮你筛了一轮，暂时没找到特别贴近的。你可以直接跟我说想怎么调整条件。", "item_type": "assistant_message"}, {"body": "江浙沪的都可以", "item_type": "user_message"}, {"body": "帮你把范围扩大到江浙沪主要城市也扫了一遍，不过目前库里刚好没有 26-36 岁、也在认真找对象的女生。别担心，这种冷启动阶段偶尔会碰到。我可以先帮你把这个条件挂上，一旦有合适的新朋友注册加入，我第一时间推给你。另外，如果愿意把年龄范围稍微放宽一点（比如 24-38），我也可以现在再帮你跑一轮看看。", "item_type": "assistant_message"}], "requester_profile_snapshot": {"age": 31, "city": "上海", "gender": "male", "has_children": false, "id": 9014, "marital_status": "未婚", "name": "孙木超", "relationship_goal": "dating"}, "session_status": "active", "visible_actions": [{"action_id": "act-9d6dfc9672eb", "hint": {}, "label": "有新人时提醒我", "style": "primary"}, {"action_id": "act-de7515d4f1a1", "hint": {}, "label": "放宽年龄再试试", "style": "secondary"}]}, "session": {"criteria_labels": ["江浙沪", "女", "26-36岁", "先谈恋爱"], "phase": "no_result", "profile_id": 9014, "requester_id": 9014, "session_id": "discovery-session-8777a9fb93ee"}}', 'role': 'user'}, {'id': 'msg_092ce7c6-36e7-427f-b0ef-06fab99960a1', 'summary': [{'text': '用户点击了"放宽年龄再试试"这个action。\n我需要先更新画像的年龄范围，然后再次搜索。\n根据之前的对话，我之前建议的是24-38岁。\n调用 sync_requester_persona_memory 更新 target_age_min 和 target_age_max。\n然后调用 search_partner_candidates。\n由于这是action_click，且用户选择了放宽年龄，我可以直接进行更新和搜索，不需要再问。\n更新 target_age_min 为 24，target_age_max 为 38。\n搜索条件：cities 保持江浙沪，age_min 24, age_max 38, gender female, relationship_goals ["dating", "认真恋爱"]。\n执行搜索。\n根据搜索结果决定下一步。\n先调用 sync_requester_persona_memory。', 'type': 'summary_text'}], 'type': 'reasoning'}, {'arguments': '{"patch_json": "{\\"target_age_min\\": 24, \\"target_age_max\\": 38}"}', 'call_id': 'call_a0ecb02c4d6b449391d3f73f', 'name': 'sync_requester_persona_memory', 'type': 'function_call', 'id': 'msg_3274e3d5-0acf-41d5-b1f3-90d5f472f317', 'status': 'completed'}, {'call_id': 'call_a0ecb02c4d6b449391d3f73f', 'output': '{\'synced\': Fa